  "description": "Outgoing and athletic, Da-Rim’s always surrounded by friends. But back in elementary school, she used to be a social outcast—she only started making friends when Tae-Hoo brought her into the fold. Now in high school, the two have drifted apart, but Da-Rim is waiting for a chance to reunite with her icy Prince Charming. There’s just one issue: Da-Rim's body transforms into a boy’s at noon every day, only to turn back at midnight! Well, if she can’t get close to Tae-Hoo as a girl… Why not try as a boy?! \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
